  "details": "More information about Unity's version of ECS here: https://unity.com/ecs\n\nI would like a request to have Unity's Entity Component System (or ECS for short) to be whitelisted and exposed to Udon.  This would allow for the ability to create more ambitious worlds where tons of objects can be managed from a single system.\n\nEDIT:  If Unity's ECS is not possible to whitelist and expose to Udon, I would like to suggest adding in either Flecs or Entt libraries for usage.  I have found C# ports of both and they are quite popular to use.\n\nFlecs: https://github.com/SanderMertens/flecs\n\nEntt: https://github.com/skypjack/entt\n\nFlecs C#: https://github.com/BeanCheeseBurrito/Flecs.NET\n\nEntt C#: https://github.com/RabbitStewDio/EnTTSharp",
